focus_prompt.user_template:
Extract metadata from this bug report:

{description}

Output JSON with exactly these fields: title (short description, max 100 chars), component (affected module/service), reporter (name or username), date (ISO 8601 or 'unknown').

Classify severity and priority for this bug:

Title: {metadata.title}
Component: {metadata.component}
Reporter: {metadata.reported_by}
Date: {metadata.date}

Output JSON: {severity: enum(critical|high|medium|low), priority: enum(P0|P1|P2|P3), reasoning: string (one sentence)}

Generate reproduction steps for this bug:

Title: {metadata.title}
Component: {metadata.component}

Raw description:
{description}

Output JSON: {steps: [{step_number: int, action: string, expected: string, actual: string}]}

Analyze root cause for this bug:

Title: {metadata.title}
Component: {metadata.component}

Reproduction steps:
{repro_steps.steps}

Generate 3 hypotheses, pick best one. Output JSON: {likely_cause: string, confidence: enum(high|medium|low), evidence: string (citing step numbers), affected_code_paths: array[string] (file paths or 'unknown')}

Assess business impact:

Severity: {severity.severity}
Priority: {severity.priority}
Component: {metadata.component}

Compute affected_users_estimate using python_eval. Output JSON: {affected_users_estimate: number, business_impact: string, sla_breach: bool}

Assemble the final bug report from all inputs.

Metadata: {metadata}
Severity: {severity}
Reproduction Steps: {repro_steps}
Root Cause: {root_cause}
Impact: {impact}

Output JSON: {report_markdown: string (full markdown), summary: string (2 sentences max), action_items: array[string] (role-prefixed concrete tasks)}
